and the database.

62
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:43,460
Composer absolutely does not act as some
hostage-holding runtime dependency forever.

63
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:47,320
You literally have the freedom to take your
code and go whenever you want.

64
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:53,840
Now, to guarantee that high level of
