66
00:04:58,280 --> 00:05:03,040
These test technical checks, creative
judgment, and actual real-world operation.

67
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:08,200
It has to be a useful app, finished in its
presentation, accurate to its claims,

68
00:05:08,780 --> 00:05:13,100
genuinely published with real distribution,
capable of continued operation,

69
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:16,280
and finally, something you are actually
proud to share.

70
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,500
You can't just pass one of these.

